  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Given: 97 ÷ 24 − 16 × 5 + 37 = 53\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/03f606139c736cc1af8c6f5c78ea44c324f88530185109c0f836e68c8ced7a54.png] \n\nBy checking options and interchanging the signs accordingly,\n\n(1) 2 and 3; ÷ and −\n\nLHS = 97 - 34 ÷ 16 × 5 + 27 \n\n= 97 - 2.125 × 5 + 27\n\n= 97 - 10.625 + 27\n\n= 124 - 10.625\n\n= 113.375 ≠ 52 (RHS)\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\n(2) 2 and 3; + and ×\n\n= 97 ÷ 34 − 16 + 5 × 27 \n\n= 2.85 - 16 + 5 × 27\n\n= 2.85 - 16 + 135\n\n= 137.85 - 16\n\n= 121.85 ≠ 52 (RHS)\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\n(3) 4 and 7; ÷ and +\n\n= 94 + 27 − 16 × 5 ÷ 34\n\n= 94 + 27 - 16 × 0.147\n\n= 94 + 27 - 2.352\n\n= 121 - 2.352\n\n= 118.648 ≠ 53 (RHS)\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\n**(4) 7 and 6; + and −**\n\n**LHS = 96 ÷ 24 + 17 × 5 - 36 **\n\n**= 4 + 17 × 5 - 36 **\n\n**= 4 + 85 - 36 **\n\n**= 89 - 36**\n\n**= 53 (RHS)**\n\n**LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, **7 and 6; + and − **is the correct answer.",
